ihv_inh
-------
l1: $ G , z = ∅ , z ⊆ n ⇒ ihv D K L g t ∅ = csn ∅ $ by ihv_zero
l2: $ G , z = ∅ , z ⊆ n ⇒ z = ∅ $ by ax
l3: $ … ⇒ ihv D K L g t z = csn ∅ $ by eq_trans [ihv_eq_arg [l2], l1]
l4: $ G , z = ∅ , z ⊆ n , b = ∅ ⇒ b = ∅ $ by ax
l5: $ … ⇒ b ∊ csn ∅ $ by csn_intro [l4]
l6: $ G , z = ∅ , z ⊆ n , b = ∅ ⇒ ihv D K L g t z = csn ∅ $ by weaken [l3]
l7: $ … ⇒ b ∊ ihv D K L g t z $ by welc_eq [eq_sym [l6], l5]
l8: $ … ⇒ ∃ e (e ∊ ihv D K L g t z) $ by ex_intro [l7]
