l60: $ G , a ∊ {z | ∃ b ∃ c ∃ e (⟨ z , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ fv t d)} , o = apn h a , v = apn h2 a ⇒ apn h a = apn h2 a $ by ex_elim [l11, l59]
l61: $ G , a ∊ {z | ∃ b ∃ c ∃ e (⟨ z , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ fv t d)} , o = apn h a ⇒ isset (apn h2 a) $ by wcel_isset [weaken [l7]]
