l24: $ G , z = ⟨ q1 , ⟨ q2 , ⟨ q3 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , x ∊ da (fv E ta) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tb w (scons x r) ∧ z = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (etel u E ta w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , q = scons x r ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
l25: $ … ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tb w q $ by wcel_eq_r [etel_eq [l23, l24, eq_sym [l21]], and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l22]]]]
l26: $ G , z = ⟨ q1 , ⟨ q2 , ⟨ q3 , q4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , x ∊ da (fv E ta) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tb w (scons x r) ∧ z = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (etel u E ta w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , q = scons x r ⇒ tb ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [weaken [#2]]
