l176: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t $ by ax
l177: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ q = scons x x3 $ by ax
l178: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ h ∊ trees ω ∧ l ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [l171]
l179: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ l ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [and_elim_r [l178]]
l180: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ l = l $ by eq_refl
l181: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
l182: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w q $ by wcel_eq_r [etel_eq [l180, l181, eq_sym [l177]], and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l176]]]]
l183: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ f ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [etel_fseq [l179, l182]]
l184: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ cdm (ssnoc f x) = suc (cdm f) $ by ssnoc_len [l183]
l185: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ cdm x5 = suc (cdm f) $ by eq_trans [cdm_eq [and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l176]]]]], l184]
l186: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ cdm x5 = z $ by ax
l187: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t ⇒ isset x3 $ by isset_var
l188: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t ⇒ isset (scons x x3) $ by scons_set [l187]
l189: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ z = suc k $ by ax
l190: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ suc (cdm f) = suc k $ by eq_trans [eq_sym [l185], eq_trans [l186, l189]]
l191: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ cdm f ∈ ω $ by fseq_len [l183]
