l280: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 , o = ap x4 x , p = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ⇒ nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3)) $ by and_intro [l267, l279]
l281: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 , o = ap x4 x ⇒ isset ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
l282: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 , o = ap x4 x ⇒ nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3)) $ by isset_elim [l281, l280]
l283: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t $ by ax
l284: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ x3 ∊ fseq u $ by ax
l285: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel → cdm x5 = k → x3 ∊ fseq u → x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 → nest x8 (apn x4 x5) ∈ fv x3 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t6)) ∧ ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x3 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_recfield t1 t2 t3 x2 x1 t6 ∈ lrel , cdm x5 = z , x3 ∊ fseq u , x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x3 , t1 = a ∧ t2 = b ∧ t3 = c ∧ x2 = d ∧ x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ t6 = j ∧ ra_recfield a b c ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ l j ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x3 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x3) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x3) t , q = scons x x3 ⇒ x4 ∊ dt u M x1 w x3 $ by ax
