l13: $ G , l = ixs td w zc , r = scat p l ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) tk w (scat p (ixs td w zc)) $ by weaken [#10]
l14: $ G , l = ixs td w zc , r = scat p l ⇒ tk = tk $ by eq_refl
l15: $ G , l = ixs td w zc , r = scat p l ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
l16: $ G , l = ixs td w zc , r = scat p l ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) tk w r $ by wcel_eq_r [etel_eq [l14, l15, eq_sym [l10]], l13]
