l69: $ G , l = ixs td w zc , r = scat p l , o ∊ fseq u ∧ fv t (fv nvf th) = etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) ta w o ∧ fv g (fv nvf th) ∈ dt u (mcv H) ta w o ∧ ∀ i (i ∊ ω → fv o (nadd (fv nvf th) i) = fv r i) , v = fv g (fv nvf th) , ra_nidx td ti m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ q4 = scat e (swin o (fv nvf th) (fv nvf te)) ∧ cdm q4 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf te) ⇒ swin (scat p l) ∅ (cdm p) = p $ by swin_scat_head [l68, l62]
