l126: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J → x1 ∊ trees ω → x2 ∊ trees ω → cdm x5 = k → x4 ∊ fseq u → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 → ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t5 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x4 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , x2 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t (x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t) $ by etel_pi_all [and_elim_l [l119], and_elim_r [l119], l124, l125, l123]
l127: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J → x1 ∊ trees ω → x2 ∊ trees ω → cdm x5 = k → x4 ∊ fseq u → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 → ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t5 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x4 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , x2 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t , q = scons x x4 ⇒ x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t $ by ax
l128: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J → x1 ∊ trees ω → x2 ∊ trees ω → cdm x5 = k → x4 ∊ fseq u → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 → ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t5 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x4 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , x2 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t , q = scons x x4 ⇒ q = scons x x4 $ by ax
l129: $ G , n = cdm q1 , k ∊ ω , ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J → x1 ∊ trees ω → x2 ∊ trees ω → cdm x5 = k → x4 ∊ fseq u → ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 → ∃ m ∃ e (ra_nidx t1 t5 m ∈ lrel ∧ e ∊ fseq {y | y = y} ∧ cdm e = fv nvf m ∧ x8 = scat e (swin x4 (fv nvf x2) (fv nvf t3)) ∧ cdm x8 = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3))) , z = suc k , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , x2 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t , q = scons x x4 ⇒ h ∊ trees ω ∧ l ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [l119]
