l22: $ G , n = cdm p1 , z = ∅ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 x3 x2 x1 ∈ lrel3 J , x1 ∊ trees ω , cdm x5 = z , x4 ∊ fseq u , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , ⟨ x9 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x0 , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x1 w x4 , x1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ ∧ d = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d l ∈ lrel3 J , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) h) w x4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) l w (scons x x4) ∧ x5 = ssnoc f x ∧ x6 = scons x g ∧ x7 = scons (etel u (dnf u M) h w x4) t ⇒ ⟨ x9 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x0 , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons h (scons l ∅) ⟩ w x4 $ by wcel_eq_r [etel_eq [l18, l19, l20], l21]
