ifold_step
----------
l1: $ G ⇒ sk ∊ {x9 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ c ∃ l ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ q (iprt td x2 x3 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x2 w ∧ ictk td x4 c l ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) l w (scat x1 (ixs td w zc)) ∧ q ∊ fseq u ∧ x9 = ⟨ x4 , ⟨ q , scons c g ⟩ ⟩)} $ by weaken [#11]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ c ∃ l ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ q (iprt td x2 x3 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) x2 w ∧ ictk td x4 c l ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) l w (scat x1 (ixs td w zc)) ∧ q ∊ fseq u ∧ sk = ⟨ x4 , ⟨ q , scons c g ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
